emo)","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PET0C8RmDFg","slug":"540","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-540/ra.1610594124","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-540"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #540","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-540.jpg","content":"Unreleased sounds and demos from the Soulection family.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-03-05T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"8Vbd9G2C724","position":45,"timestamp":"01:27:24","rawTrack":"Unknown - Spottie Ottie Dubalicious","track":{"id":"Au1Iz1gczkI","path":"/artists/unknown/tracks/spottie-ottie-dubalicious/","slug":"spottie-ottie-dubalicious","title":"Spottie Ottie Dubalicious","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":"images/artists/unknown/tracks/spottie-ottie-dubalicious.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"BNwDfIRNXH8","slug":"543","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-543/ra.1614873854","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-543-live-from-the-sinclair-boston"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #543","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-543.jpg","content":"Joe Kay is live from The Sinclair in Boston.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-03-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"oDmwVwari5o","position":16,"timestamp":"00:22:44","rawTrack":"Unknown - untitled","track":{"id":"HCm5NVd2B24","path":"/artists/unknown/tracks/untitled/","slug":"untitled","title":"Untitled","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"JVZNWJkTDaw","slug":"549","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-549/ra.1622527891","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-549"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #549","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-549.jpg","content":"A mix from Joe Kay’s vault filled with classic R&B gems.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-05-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"yOkWSBRwgtA","position":66,"timestamp":"01:46:16","rawTrack":"Unknown - Untitled","track":{"id":"HCm5NVd2B24","path":"/artists/unknown/tracks/untitled/","slug":"untitled","title":"Untitled","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"JVZNWJkTDaw","slug":"549","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-549/ra.1622527891","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-549"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #549","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-549.jpg","content":"A mix from Joe Kay’s vault filled with classic R&B gems.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-05-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"D9WHiYYKIiM","position":26,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Unknown - Baduism","track":{"id":"89agTAFr3y8","path":"/artists/unknown/tracks/baduism/","slug":"baduism","title":"Baduism","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":"images/artists/unknown/tracks/baduism.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"xEj4AlSU7Es","slug":"137","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-137-w-mr"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #137 w/ Mr. Carmack & Mikos Da Gawd","artwork":"/images/episodes/137.jpg","content":"\nMikos Da Gawd and Mr. Carmack each drop amazing sets of unreleased, original productions.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nJoe Kay kicked things off for the first half of the show! He dropped a lot of exclusives and forgotten gems. Mikos Da Gawd dropped a 30+ minute DJ set that consisted of many gems and original productions from the man himself. Mr. Carmack wrapped up the show with an amazing listening session of all of his latest unreleased works. Man, all we gotta say is that Carmack is one of the best in the game right now. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10806,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-07-20T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"aV4G63eKN0E","position":3,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Unknown - If It’s Lovin’ That You Want (Blackedout Remix)","track":{"id":"EP9MmUugNeY","path":"/artists/unknown/tracks/if-it-s-lovin-that-you-want-blackedout-remix/","slug":"if-its-lovin-that-you-want-blackedout-remix","title":"If It’s Lovin’ That You Want (Blackedout Remix)","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"mT0b7zueZhI","slug":"138","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-138-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #138 w/ Great Dane","artwork":"/images/episodes/138.jpg","content":"\nProducer Great Dane (co-founder of Team Supreme) delivers energy and bass\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nFor this show we had the young and progressive producer Great Dane who is the co-founder of one of the best collectives in LA (Team Supreme) and an artist on Alpha Pup. Joe Kay kicked things off for the first hour & 28 minutes of exclusive material ranging from Mr. Carmack, Kaytranada, Sango, Jo Def, Esta, and many others. Great Dane truly understands our memo when we say, 'NO TIME FOR FILLER TRACKS'. As soon as he hit play constant energy and bass started flowing. He played an exclusive 45 minute set which consisted of all original productions except for two tracks. This won't be the last time you hear from him.\n \n\n\n\n Thanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10810,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-07-27T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Interview w/ Great Dane","position":2}},{"id":"cySiE1kXrEA","position":0,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Unknown - Untitled","track":{"id":"HCm5NVd2B24","path":"/artists/unknown/tracks/untitled/","slug":"untitled","title":"Untitled","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"lvLR-jIK1BU","slug":"145","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-145"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #145","artwork":"/images/episodes/145.jpg","content":"\nJoe selects 60 minutes of energy from Soulection HQ\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":3662,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-21T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"_2cLmnVDsQM","position":59,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Unknown - That Life","track":{"id":"hraPo5hjLTY","path":"/artists/unknown/tracks/that-life/","slug":"that-life","title":"That Life","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-146"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"xLg5kwuegxA","position":34,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Unknown - Untitled","track":{"id":"HCm5NVd2B24","path":"/artists/unknown/tracks/untitled/","slug":"untitled","title":"Untitled","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"xj9ohERACh8","slug":"153","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-153-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #153 w/ Dream Koala","artwork":"/images/episodes/153.jpg","content":"\nJoe Kay kicked things off with heavy, heavy vibes from many brand new/unheard artists and collectives. \n<!--more-->\n\nThe selection in here was really well thought out and analyzed properly so take notes.\n\nShouts to Geode and the Chord Marauders who sent over their forthcoming compilation which is simply amazing. Pay attention to these guys, trust. Also look out for Sunni Colòn & Jarreau Vandal. These two artists will be breakthrough artists on Soulection in 2014; guaranteed. We had special guest Dream Koala stop by who is visiting LA for his 1st time all the way from Berlin (current residence but originally from Paris). The young 19 year old threw down a DJ set that included bass and uptempo tribal vibes. In fact, his set was very different from his original production. Dream Koala is very talented and we look forward to see and hear what's to come. \n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10840,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-23T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"CCk__Tf9B4U","position":2,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Unknown - Untitled","track":{"id":"HCm5NVd2B24","path":"/artists/unknown/tracks/untitled/","slug":"untitled","title":"Untitled","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"72tsP5bkPCY","slug":"157","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-157"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #157","artwork":"/images/episodes/157.jpg","content":"Joe Kay drops a 60 minute set of some stand out selects that he either just discovered, was holding onto, and rediscovered. \n\n<!--more-->\nWe played back a few cuts from last week such as the intro track by Yung Gud! God this track is a bad one even Sango is opening up with it at his recent shows.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":3723,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-21T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"erUb3UYZ_R4","position":33,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Unknown - Untitled","track":{"id":"HCm5NVd2B24","path":"/artists/unknown/tracks/untitled/","slug":"untitled","title":"Untitled","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"TRF9MBRGUQ8","slug":"160","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-160-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #160 w/ Zikomo","artwork":"/images/episodes/160.jpg","content":"Zikomo gives us a special 1 hour set of exclusive tracks\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10949,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-11T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"SbGFrLFxpno","position":34,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Unknown - Untitled","track":{"id":"HCm5NVd2B24","path":"/artists/unknown/tracks/untitled/","slug":"untitled","title":"Untitled","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"TRF9MBRGUQ8","slug":"160","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-160-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #160 w/ Zikomo","artwork":"/images/episodes/160.jpg","content":"Zikomo gives us a special 1 hour set of exclusive tracks\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10949,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-11T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"k-G0H7U00Cc","position":35,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Unknown - Untitled","track":{"id":"HCm5NVd2B24","path":"/artists/unknown/tracks/untitled/","slug":"untitled","title":"Untitled","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"TRF9MBRGUQ8","slug":"160","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-160-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #160 w/ Zikomo","artwork":"/images/episodes/160.jpg","content":"Zikomo gives us a special 1 hour set of exclusive tracks\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10949,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-11T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"4zZ4U9vhSkA","position":52,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Unknown - Untitled","track":{"id":"HCm5NVd2B24","path":"/artists/unknown/tracks/untitled/","slug":"untitled","title":"Untitled","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"AfbBMadJe6c","slug":"162","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-162"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #162","artwork":"/images/episodes/162.jpg","content":"Joe reaches out to the listeners for the People Choice\n\n<!--more-->\n\nComing off Grammy week connections and our 3 Year Anniversary we returned for yet another solid show. Our special guests who were scheduled for this show couldn't make it but Joe Kay brought out a variety of new and classic gems from the Soulection crates. This show was really engaging because Joe reached out to all the listeners and asked the audience what they wanted to hear via social media. It was amazing to see how many people were listening and how many people requested for a certain track. For the last hour and 1/2 you the people we're DJ'ing/selecting music! How amazing right? Try to tune in live next time. The live feelings is always better. We'll catch you next week at the same time. Spread this if you feel it because it really is strictly about the music. Stay tuned for our 3 Year Anniversary Party announcement on Monday (1/27/14).\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10811,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"DOiCU1QpeGs","position":36,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Unknown - Untitled","track":{"id":"HCm5NVd2B24","path":"/artists/unknown/tracks/untitled/","slug":"untitled","title":"Untitled","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"71ZXZF57G88","slug":"163","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-163-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #163 w/ Little Simz","artwork":"/images/episodes/163.jpg","content":"Little Sims joins Joe Kay with an exclusive Soulection mix.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11016,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"ZMRLYF6ZTx4","position":37,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Unknown - Untitled","track":{"id":"HCm5NVd2B24","path":"/artists/unknown/tracks/untitled/","slug":"untitled","title":"Untitled","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"mTiCVWagnSk","slug":"165","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-165-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #165 w/ Lakim, Andres, Sunni Colòn, & J-Louis","artwork":"/images/episodes/165.jpg","content":"Soulection 3 Year pre-party Celebration!\n<!--more-->\n\nWe had a packed house at Kbeach with plenty of good vibes flowing. In fact it was Joe's first time meeting Lakim in person after all these years. This is Lakim's first time out in L.A. so we wanted to make sure Lakim was welcomed properly. We had him drop a quick preview set on the radio show and talk about his forthcoming album \"This Is Her\" a little. We also had Andres drop a quick set to switch up the vibes, After Andres, we had Sunni Colòn & J-Louis both come on and preview some remixes that we've been putting together. So much talent in one room. Big ups to Marvel Alexander and shouts to everyone who came out to our 3 year Anniversary party. It was massive and hectic at the same time. Stay tuned for our announcement to our new Soulection monthly.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10806,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-15T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"W-8M5zh9bfE","position":37,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Unknown - Untitled","track":{"id":"HCm5NVd2B24","path":"/artists/unknown/tracks/untitled/","slug":"untitled","title":"Untitled","artist":{"slug":"unknown","title":"Unknown"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"mTiCVWagnSk","slug":"165